WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
One first choice. Two different
thirds.

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.260
In RecoScope's November 21st
office chair snapshot,

3
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.690
Steelcase appeared in 11 of 12
usable answers

4
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.320
and ranked first in all four
comparisons.

5
00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.200
Herman Miller was second in every
comparison.

6
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.700
Third place split.

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.360
Haworth in ChatGPT and Gemini,

8
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.680
Branch in Claude and Perplexity.

9
00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.310
Four assistants answered three
saved prompts

10
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.630
for a U.S. remote worker

11
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.160
with long desk days and lower back
pain.

12
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.710
Branch and SIHOO appeared in all
four

13
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.480
under $400 answers.

14
00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.100
Mentions don't verify final
prices,

15
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.920
warranties, or suitability.

16
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:41.020
On November 15th, Steelcase was
first in three comparisons.

17
00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.400
Today, four.

18
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.920
One changed answer is not a trend.

19
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.980
For your brand, measure mentions
and ranks separately.

20
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.960
These findings describe captured
answers, not product quality.

21
